    "summary": "**[Blast](vsdata:core-rule/blast)**. Use the target’s model count at **Select Targets**. Each full group of five adds one attack die, or the listed number for **[BLAST X]**, when you gather dice. **[Close-Quarters Shooting](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters-shooting)** prevents a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** from using Blast against units engaged with its own unit. The FAQ also excludes an engaged **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** from Blast as a target.",
